    <briefdescription>
<para>5-phase cost model for Tensor-RAG query planning. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Models the end-to-end latency of a Tensor-RAG pipeline as the sum of five independently tunable phases:</para>
<para>C_RAG = C_embed + C_retrieve + C_rerank + C_assemble + C_generate</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>TensorWorkloadClassifier is not present in the current codebase; the WorkloadType::TENSOR_RAG enum value should be added there when it is introduced (forward-declaration note kept here for integration).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
